the discoveries, the rules,

302
00:08:45,810 --> 00:08:46,840
the shared gain.

303
00:08:47,270 --> 00:08:49,000
That leaves the hardest question,

304
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:50,870
the one no ballot can settle.

305
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:52,390
5 years from now,

306
00:08:52,430 --> 00:08:53,410
at another wedding,

307
00:08:53,450 --> 00:08:55,320
a stranger asks what you do.

308
00:08:56,340 --> 00:08:57,670
Who do you want to be,

309
00:08:57,710 --> 00:08:58,910
when nobody needs you

310
00:08:58,950 --> 00:09:00,110
for your thinking?

311
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:02,190
It can sound like a loss.

312
00:09:02,430 --> 00:09:03,630
But listen again:

313
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:04,600
it is the question

314
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:06,000
we ask children.

315
00:09:06,220 --> 00:09:07,400
What do you want to be?

316
00:09:07,690 --> 00:09:09,000
For most of history,

317
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,290
a change this big

318
00:09:10,330 --> 00:09:11,870
was left to the children.

319
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:14,750
This one is yours: the warning,

320
00:09:14,820 --> 00:09:16,630
the work, and the wonder.

321
00:09:17,690 --> 00:09:18,590
There is no next

322
00:09:18,630 --> 00:09:20,270
generation to wait for.

323
00:09:20,450 --> 00:09:21,750
This time, the next

324
00:09:21,790 --> 00:09:23,420
generation is you.

325
00:09:24,570 --> 00:09:25,680
This channel exists

326
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,040
so that superintelligence

327
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,780
goes well for everybody.

328
00:09:28,990 --> 00:09:31,240
For this generation, and the next.

329
00:09:31,390 --> 00:09:32,390
Want that too?

330
00:09:32,470 --> 00:09:33,550
Then subscribe.

